      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦哦，这真厉害！！　一口气追了上去……！！\n什么嘛，不是挺有能力的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d622b9e2d9165f2006917a9a86115d8887846f6be3935950528307c202bc02d9",
