      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那瞬间爆发力，\n是连领先200米开外的马娘都能感受到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d894e887f13938bfb97443cf9a9e39f5d1f59048e46c34a8b59c57fd627d19",
